CORE gcc-only
main.c
-I include --validate-goto-model
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ assertion r == 1\.0 \|\| r == -1\.0: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ assertion r == -1\.0: FAILURE$
^\[copysign\.no-body\.unmodelled_signbit\] line \d+ no body for callee unmodelled_signbit: FAILURE$
^\*\* 2 of \d+ failed
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^Invariant check failed
--
unmodelled_signbit has no body: its call fails the no-body check, and the
sign of the result is unknown, so assertion.2 fails.
